            "-y, -ous, -ive, -able, -al, -ish, -ic, -en build adjectives.",
            "Watch the spelling: famous, sunny.",
            "Un-, in-, im-, dis- make opposites."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "key_takeaway": "Know the ending and you can build the adjective.",
